   139	  - Agreement by the frozen scorer's rule (`prod_records.outcome` for the old system; for the new system the same rule, as Stage B counted
   140	    it: "Ruled out" and "Still open" answer no, `stage_b/control_theses.py`).
   141	- **Printed:** per ruler question and draw, its outcome; and per draw and system, the agreements on the seven graded questions.
